Hi {Owner},

I build websites for boutique hotels and serviced apartments around {City}. {Business Name} has great reviews, but the Book button on your site leads to a travel site listing and the rooms share one page, so guests who find you directly have little reason to book with you.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: direct booking with your own perks, a page for each room and apartment type, long-stay and corporate rates, a group room-block enquiry and a neighbourhood guide, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to your domain, connect your current booking engine and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. You approve every page before launch. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
